1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,038
29 percent off this controller
for Black Friday.

2
00:00:03,088 --> 00:00:05,346
For real? It's 14 percent.

3
00:00:05,396 --> 00:00:08,129
And the AI even found it
cheaper somewhere else.

4
00:00:08,179 --> 00:00:11,305
I'll show you how to check any
deal in thirty seconds.

5
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,138
Look under the price.

6
00:00:13,188 --> 00:00:17,138
The 29 percent is calculated on the
"recommended price".

7
00:00:17,188 --> 00:00:21,902
But the rule is the lowest price of
the last thirty days.

8
00:00:21,952 --> 00:00:23,974
Here: 65 euros.

9
00:00:24,024 --> 00:00:26,791
So the real discount is 14 percent.

10
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:30,630
Step one: copy the product link
from the address bar.

11
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:36,448
Step two: open an AI that searches the web,
like Claude, ChatGPT or Gemini.

12
00:00:36,498 --> 00:00:38,377
Paste the link, and ask: is
this a real deal?

13
00:00:38,427 --> 00:00:42,754
Look up the price history and the
price at other sellers.

14
00:00:42,804 --> 00:00:45,384
Answer in three lines, with your sources.

15
00:00:45,630 --> 00:00:47,835
Step three: read the verdict.

16
00:00:47,885 --> 00:00:51,804
Here, the AI says: a real deal,
but not the best one.

17
00:00:51,854 --> 00:00:56,865
On Black Friday 2024, it was
already 54.99 euros.

18
00:00:56,915 --> 00:01:00,066
And another site sells it one
euro cheaper right now.

19
00:01:00,116 --> 00:01:02,486
Verdict: don't buy it at this price.

20
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:03,821
Two traps.

21
00:01:03,871 --> 00:01:06,284
One: the AI can be wrong.

22
00:01:06,334 --> 00:01:09,583
Here, it says itself that it
couldn't open the page.

23
00:01:09,633 --> 00:01:12,096
Always click its sources.

24
00:01:12,146 --> 00:01:16,061
Two: compare the same model, the same
color, the same version.

25
00:01:16,111 --> 00:01:18,597
Otherwise, the comparison is worthless.

26
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:23,838
Result: thirty seconds, zero euros, and
you dodge a fake bargain.

27
00:01:23,888 --> 00:01:26,749
My exact question is free in
the description.

28
00:01:26,799 --> 00:01:29,550
Subscribe for more AI tips
before Christmas.

